<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Works well with any attacker weapon, or high recoil guns</Major>
    <Description>Works well with all attacker weapons with tinkering on loadout, or other high recoil weapons

Changes from V1: Delays have been lengthened within command to eliminate the weird pausing noise caused when shooting slow firing weapons like the 552 commando. This also makes this able to be used with lower recoil slow weapons like the 556 XL if used without a vert grip. This is notably harder to control ultra high recoil weapons like the F2, but the increased compatability is worth it IMO

Res: 16:10, 1920 x1080

Sensitivity 6,6

800 Dpi</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 5 19
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 29
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 24
Delay 20 ms
MoveR -10 19
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>